OL,3,GNEWSABreeding success for swift nesting
OL,4,Aproject
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials behind a swift conservation
OL,7,Fproject in Leicestershire have found
OL,8,Fevidence of breeding attempts in nest
OL,9,Fboxes placed across the county.
OL,11,FMore than 360 nest boxes were installed
OL,12,Fas part of the joint venture between
OL,13,FLeicestershire County Council's Swift
OL,14,FAction for Swifts project and the
OL,15,FLeicestershire and Rutland
OL,16,FOrnithological Society (LROS).
OL,18,FThe team behind the project to boost
OL,19,Fthe swift population said monitoring of
OL,20,Fthe boxes is continuing, but a total of
OL,21,Fsix breeding attempts have been
OL,22,Fconfirmed.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
